<title>USA: Xerox Corp to issue $300 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Xerox Corp to issue $300 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xerox Corp is expected to issue a $300 million 20-year debt offering via lead underwriter, Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, as early as Wednesday afternoon, high-grade syndicate sources said.</p>
<p>The issue, which carries a put option in the seventh and 12th years, is expected to price at 20 basis points to the seven-year put, they added.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
